# Conformance probe pack for the `tlv` wire (spec 0.13). Public. A field and
# two `const` lines on one path: the item is written once, with the earliest
# `const` value (ruling 9 of 0.13).
format        conformance-tlv-const
version       0.13.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          tlv

field    probe.n      5:1      uint
const    5:1          1
const    5:1          2
